      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "どのシドも素晴らしい飛空艇技師だけど……。\r\n一番好きなのは、やっぱり初代。\r\nアタシにとって、シドと言えば初代なの。",
        "official_en": "All of them were excellent airship engineers, but to me, the first Cid will always be the best.",
        "real_en": "Every Cid was a wonderful airship engineer, but the first is still my favorite. When I think of Cid, I think of him."
